{"id":"6695:309871","name":"颜色 / 完善版","texts":[{"id":"6695:309876","text":"颜色 / Typography","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309877","text":"五、色彩方案\n\n\n​​​\n","visible":false},{"id":"6695:309889","text":"主色：幸福绿","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309890","text":"#00B2B2","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309891","text":"色彩采用：颜色需要突显“专业感”与“温度感”，同时确保信息可读性，通过色彩传递“数据可信赖、决策有依据、服务有温度”的核心价值，适配数据看板的可视化需求与用户使用场景。。","visible":false},{"id":"6695:309892","text":"图表色（相近色系\r)","visible":false},{"id":"6695:309895","text":"#00B2B2","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309896","text":"达标","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309899","text":"#FEB7B7","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309900","text":"缺口/负值","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309903","text":"#FFAC46","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309904","text":"未达标","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309907","text":"#22262F","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309908","text":"指标","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309909","text":"功能色（强对比色\r)","visible":false},{"id":"6695:309912","text":"#0FD486","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309915","text":"#FF375F","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309916","text":"语义色（规范化标准色\r)","visible":false},{"id":"6695:309917","text":"二、核心理念解构​​\n\n“洞察”=不止于“展示数据”，更需洞察本质——专业性\n\n“实时”=数据及时更新与动态感知——动态感\n\n“信任”=准确的数据是构建信任的基础——信任度\n​​​\n","visible":false},{"id":"6695:309918","text":"一、品牌基因\n\n","visible":false},{"id":"6695:309919","text":"\n\n围绕“服务-数据-人”的三角关系，紧密结合行业的服务属性、数据价值、用户需求三大核心，同时突出数据工具的功能性、易用性与情感联结。兼顾行业特性与产品差异化，解决一看数据分散、决策低效的痛点，又通过温度感与可信度强化了情感联结，从而定义的品牌基因——“洞察”、“实时”、“信任”。\n","visible":false},{"id":"6695:309920","text":"四、色彩心理学映射表\n\n\n​​​\n","visible":false},{"id":"6695:309921","text":"三、配色逻辑\n\n主色​​：采用中心品牌色#00B2B2（幸福绿）作为主色，传递“高效+服务温度”；辅助色围绕“洞察（专业深度）”“实时（动态活力）”“信任（可靠安心）”三个基因扩展，形成层次分明、场景适配的色彩体系。\n\n\n\n","visible":false},{"id":"6695:309929","text":"颜色","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309930","text":"主色","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309931","text":"名称","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309932","text":"幸福绿（#00B2B2）","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309933","text":"情感触发","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309934","text":"高效+服务温度","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309947","text":"辅色","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309948","text":"辅色","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309949","text":"辅色","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309950","text":"辅色","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309951","text":"湖蓝（#2AB0F4）","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309952","text":"紫蓝（#5C8EF9）","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309953","text":"暖紫（#B377EE）","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309954","text":"亮橘（#FF8B64）","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309955","text":"理性/专业深度","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309956","text":"洞察/专业深度","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309957","text":"信任/可靠安心","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309958","text":"温暖/动态活力","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309962","text":"辅色","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309963","text":"暖黄（#FEA94A）","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309964","text":"温暖/动态活力","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309968","text":"#33C1C1","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309971","text":"#444F60","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309974","text":"#9199A2","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309977","text":"#22262F","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309980","text":"#444F60","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309983","text":"#9199A2","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309986","text":"#56B8FF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309989","text":"#2DCAE0","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309992","text":"#3DC7F8","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309995","text":"#66A6FF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:309998","text":"#949CF8","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310001","text":"#949CF8","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310004","text":"#8EAAD4","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310005","text":"中性色（纯色)","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310007","text":"文字/图标 ","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310010","text":"强调/正文标题/主要指标","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310011","text":"#22262F","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310014","text":"次强调/正文标题强调","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310015","text":"#444F60","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310018","text":"次要信息-深","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310019","text":"#9199A2","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310020","text":"填充","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310023","text":"常规/白底悬浮","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310024","text":"#F2F3F5","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310025","text":"线条","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310028","text":"分割线","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310029","text":"#EEEEEE","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310032","text":"背景","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310033","text":"#F3F8F8","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310036","text":"#FFFFFF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310039","text":"提示信息/禁用","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310040","text":"#CCCFD6","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310043","text":"纯白文字","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310044","text":"#FFFFFF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310045","text":"数据上涨/正常/成功/已完成","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310046","text":"数据下跌/警告/异常/失败/未完成","visible":false},{"id":"6695:310049","text":"颜色 / Color Guidelines","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310050","text":"先确定颜色的角色与业务语义，再选择色值；品牌、分类、正负、风险、控件选中分别定义。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310051","text":"2026.10.21 · 项目明文 / 样本实测 / 补充建议分别标记","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310053","text":"01 / 品牌与辅助色","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310054","text":"沿原目标保留品牌主色及辅助候选；不以品牌心理描述替代图表的数据编码。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310058","text":"品牌 / 选中","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310059","text":"#00B2B2","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310060","text":"目标主色；项目Tab选中使用。不是所有图表的默认数据色。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310063","text":"湖蓝","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310064","text":"#2AB0F4","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310065","text":"原目标品牌辅助候选；不替代实测系列色。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310068","text":"紫蓝","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310069","text":"#5C8EF9","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310070","text":"原目标品牌辅助候选；按具体品牌场景选择。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310073","text":"暖紫","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310074","text":"#B377EE","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310075","text":"原目标品牌辅助候选；不默认表示异常。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310079","text":"亮橘","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310080","text":"#FF8B64","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310081","text":"原目标品牌辅助候选；不直接复用为风险灯黄。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310084","text":"暖黄","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310085","text":"#FEA94A","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310086","text":"原目标品牌辅助候选；与风险灯#FFAC46分开。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310088","text":"02 / 中性色与文字层级","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310092","text":"主值 / 强调","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310093","text":"#22262F","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310094","text":"主要数值与重要正文；图表、字体板保持一致。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310097","text":"正文 / 次强调","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310098","text":"#444F60","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310099","text":"正文、指标名、一般说明。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310102","text":"弱信息","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310103","text":"#9199A2","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310104","text":"辅助信息、未选Tab等现有角色；重要读数不依赖弱灰小字。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310107","text":"提示 / 禁用候选","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310108","text":"#CCCFD6","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310109","text":"原目标提示/禁用；问数还用作参考线，不把所有同色都解释为禁用。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310113","text":"卡片 / 表面","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310114","text":"#FFFFFF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310115","text":"主卡、明细及弹层白底；需与页面背景区分。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310118","text":"页面背景","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310119","text":"#F3F8F8","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310120","text":"实际项目与目标页背景角色。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310123","text":"弱填充","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310124","text":"#F2F3F5","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310125","text":"目标中性填充；不冒充缺失值或0值。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310128","text":"通用分割线","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310129","text":"#EEEEEE","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310130","text":"目标通用分割线；与图表网格分开记录。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310134","text":"详情网格","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310135","text":"#E5E6EB","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310136","text":"项目趋势网格样本，描边0.5、虚线[2,2]。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310139","text":"问数网格变体","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310140","text":"#E5E5E5","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310141","text":"问数样本变体，不静默与详情网格合并。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310143","text":"03 / 状态、方向与风险","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310144","text":"修正原“上涨=正常=成功=已完成”的合并表述。方向不等于好坏，未完成不等于失败，是否达标由业务阈值判断。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310148","text":"风险灯 / 绿","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310149","text":"#0FD486","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310150","text":"具体业务达到该版绿灯条件；不是所有指标上涨。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310153","text":"风险灯 / 黄","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310154","text":"#FFAC46","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310155","text":"业务处于该版黄灯区间；不等于全部“未完成”。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310158","text":"风险灯 / 红","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310159","text":"#FF375F","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310160","text":"业务达到红灯阈值；同色还可用于负值，但语义分开。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310163","text":"正值柱 / 本期","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310164","text":"#33C1C1","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310165","text":"现金流正值的方向编码，结合零线及符号。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310169","text":"负值柱 / 本期","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310170","text":"#FF375F","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310171","text":"现金流负值方向编码，不能仅靠颜色判断好坏。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310174","text":"历史浅粉候选","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310175","text":"#FEB7B7","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310176","text":"目标曾用于缺口/负值；不是当前项目统一负值主色，也不当全部错误文字色。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310178","text":"04 / 图表配色的语义映射","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310181","text":"收费率单环","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310185","text":"#66A7FF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310187","text":"有效弧实测蓝色；完整底轨同系色、节点透明度0.10。填充弧的opacity与描边透明度分开记录。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310188","text":"项目实测 / 4424:84468","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310191","text":"独立多环底轨","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310195","text":"#33C1C1","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310198","text":"#56B8FF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310201","text":"#959CF9","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310203","text":"外/中/内轨对应主体，底轨透明度0.14；有效弧存在近似色差，不静默归一。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310204","text":"项目实测 / 4424:74002","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310207","text":"账龄构成","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310211","text":"#33C1C1","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310214","text":"#2ECAE0","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310217","text":"#3FC7F8","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310220","text":"#56B8FF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310223","text":"#66A7FF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310226","text":"#959CF9","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310228","text":"样本分类顺序；账龄依业务区间排列，分类—图例—金额保持映射，不把颜色顺序当所有业务的固定顺序。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310229","text":"项目实测 / 4424:72130","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310232","text":"问数多曲线","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310236","text":"#66A6FF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310239","text":"#33C1C1","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310242","text":"#3DC7F8","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310245","text":"#8EAAD4","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310247","text":"同一系列的曲线、选点、图例和明细对应。#66A6FF与单环#66A7FF分别保留。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310248","text":"项目实测 / 4424:83315","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310251","text":"现金流正负","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310255","text":"#33C1C1","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310258","text":"#FF375F","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310260","text":"正/负由零轴方向与符号共同表达；本期opacity1，同期0.5。深浅编码时期，颜色编码符号。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310261","text":"项目实测 / 4424:85061","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310264","text":"预存金额环","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310268","text":"#66A6FF","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310271","text":"#949CF8","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310273","text":"蓝紫区分构成；底轨是可见描边12、描边透明度0.14，前景描边14、节点透明度0.98。以原始浮点采集为准。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310274","text":"项目实测 / 4424:84732","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310277","text":"业务风险矩阵","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310281","text":"#0FD486","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310284","text":"#FFAC46","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310287","text":"#FF375F","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310289","text":"灯号按具体指标阈值计算；总流出与总流入方向不同，缺失或分母0不可自行亮绿。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310290","text":"项目实测 / 4424:85610、4424:86517","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310292","text":"05 / 透明度与背景","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310296","text":"本期正值","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310297","text":"#33C1C1 / opacity 1 / 白底","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310300","text":"同期正值","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310301","text":"#33C1C1 / opacity 0.5 / 白底","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310304","text":"独立环底轨","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310305","text":"#33C1C1 / opacity 0.14 / 白底","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310308","text":"单环底轨","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310309","text":"#66A7FF / opacity 0.1 / 白底","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310310","text":"以上为同背景下的可编辑色块演示。预存环底轨采用描边透明度，前景节点opacity0.98，不能与填充轨道直接混为同一种实现。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310312","text":"06 / 应用规则与未定义项","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310314","text":"品牌意图与数据编码分开","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310315","text":"目标已有“洞察、实时、信任”的品牌定位，可指导整体视觉。品牌辅助候选、分类系列色、正负色、灯号色和控件选中色分别定义，不能用品牌心理描述替代数据规则。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310317","text":"系列映射保持稳定（建议）","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310318","text":"同一业务系列跨日期、筛选和相关页面保持颜色对应；分类排序变化时不随序号重新换色。图例、选点、图形和明细一致；系列新增时再核对色序及辨识度。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310320","text":"透明度不是新色号","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310321","text":"同一底色在白底、页面底或叠加填充上的视觉不同；opacity需连同背景及作用层记录。节点opacity、paint.opacity、渐变停靠点不能互相替代，嵌套透明度需实际核对。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310323","text":"线型与深浅另有语义","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310324","text":"项目某些同期用虚线，但widget“合计”也用虚线。现金流同期用半透明柱。不要只写“虚线=同期、浅色=禁用”，须写清对应业务。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310326","text":"文字与可辨识性（建议）","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310327","text":"浅青、弱灰和风险色在白底的小字可能偏弱。关键数值保留深文字色；图例同时用名称、形状/线型及数值，不能仅靠红绿或近色辨认。真实尺寸、灰度及实际背景需检查，本次不宣称完成无障碍验收。","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310329","text":"色差、主题与发布边界","visible":true},{"id":"6695:310330","text":"#66A6FF/#66A7FF、#3DC7F8/#3FC7F8、#949CF8/#959CF9等按来源记录；本次不强制统一、不修改全局变量。暗色、高对比主题及色盲替代配色尚未定义。","visible":true}]}
